{"4773640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PNG BATTLE", "steam_appid": 4773640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One day, someone had a thought.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What if a Tyrannosaurus Rex fought a sentient dump truck — who would win?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Could a cosmic being and an elephant shrew actually go toe-to-toe?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every wild, magnificent idea you've ever had — we make it real.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;PNG BATTLE&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773640/extras/7a1e6ff5cf8201e42bec2b2ebda8fa25.poster.avif?t=1784873937\" width=902 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773640/extras/7a1e6ff5cf8201e42bec2b2ebda8fa25.webm?t=1784873937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773640/extras/7a1e6ff5cf8201e42bec2b2ebda8fa25.mp4?t=1784873937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Customized to Your Core! The Beyond-Imagination Meme Machine</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just a game — it's the ultimate meme machine in the universe!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly bring those bizarre, hilarious match-ups you've only ever imagined straight into the game.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, infinite outcomes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated tools needed! With just a few clicks, customize your own sounds, outrageous attack effects, and unique skins on top of your base hero.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class